}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Admin Get All Transactions

  Fetches all wallet and service transactions across every user for the admin dashboard or admin transactions page.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/admin/transactions`

  ## Authentication

  Admin JWT required.

  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```

  ## Query Params

  `page`
  Optional page number. Default is `1`.

  `limit`
  Optional page size. Default is `20`, maximum is `100`.

  `search`
  Optional search across transaction reference, provider reference, provider, narration, service, customer reference, and basic user fields.

  `userId`
  Optional. Return transactions for one user only.

  `type`
  Optional. Supported values include `funding`, `credit`, `debit`, `transfer`, `referral_earning`, `referral_redeem`, `service_payment`, and `reversal`.

  `status`
  Optional. Supported values: `pending`, `successful`, `failed`, `reversed`.

  `direction`
  Optional. Supported values: `credit`, `debit`.

  `walletType`
  Optional. Supported values: `main`, `referral`.

  `provider`
  Optional provider filter, for example `billxpress_admin`, `maplerad`, `monnify`, `vtpass`, `smeapi`, or another provider key.

  `service`
  Optional service filter from transaction metadata. Useful values include `data`, `airtime`, `electricity`, `cable_tv`, and `social_growth`.

  `dateFrom`, `dateTo`
  Optional ISO date filters on `createdAt`. Aliases: `startDate`, `endDate`.

  `amountMin`, `amountMax`
  Optional naira amount filters. Example: `amountMin=1000&amountMax=5000`.

  ## Examples

  Latest transactions:

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/transactions?page=1&limit=20
  ```

  Successful data purchases:

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/transactions?service=data&status=successful
  ```

  Search by user, reference, provider, or customer reference:

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/transactions?search=BXP_123
  ```

  ## Frontend Usage

  Recommended table columns:

  - date/time
  - user name/email/phone
  - service
  - transaction type
  - direction
  - amount
  - status
  - provider
  - BillXpress reference
  - provider reference
  - narration

  Use `details` for service-specific display without parsing raw metadata:

  - data: `details.network`, `details.planName`, `details.phone`
  - airtime: `details.network`, `details.airtimeValue`, `details.phone`
  - electricity: `details.disco`, `details.meterNumber`, `details.token`, `details.units`
  - cable TV: `details.tvProvider`, `details.smartcardNumber`, `details.packageName`

  ## Success Response

  ```json
  {
    "transactions": [
      {
        "id": "transaction_id",
        "user": {
          "id": "user_id",
          "firstName": "Ada",
          "lastName": "Lovelace",
          "username": "ada",
          "email": "ada@example.com",
          "phone": "08012345678",
          "role": "user"
        },
        "type": "service_payment",
        "walletType": "main",
        "direction": "debit",
        "amount": 1000,
        "balanceBefore": 5000,
        "balanceAfter": 4000,
        "currency": "NGN",
        "reference": "ELEC_...",
        "provider": "vtpass",
        "providerReference": "provider_ref",
        "status": "successful",
        "narration": "Electricity purchase: IKEDC NGN 1000",
        "token": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
        "tokenNumber": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
        "units": "12.4",
        "service": "electricity",
        "details": {
          "service": "electricity",
          "disco": "IKEDC",
          "meterNumber": "12345678901",
          "meterType": "prepaid",
          "phone": "08012345678",
          "electricityValue": 1000,
          "sellingPrice": 1000,
          "token": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
          "units": "12.4",
          "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
          "customerReference": "customer-order-1001"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "service": "electricity",
          "token": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
          "units": "12.4"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-08-22T08:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "summary": {
      "totalCount": 250,
      "totalAmount": 500000,
      "byStatus": {
        "successful": {
          "count": 200,
          "amount": 450000,
          "rawAmount": 45000000
        }
      }
    },
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 20,
      "total": 250,
      "pages": 13
    }
  }
  ```
}
